      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"Please run DRAGON on our RNA and proteomics tables from the same 70 heart failure patients; both tables share the patient IDs.\" -- available from DRAGON, run with its own settings (the settings asked for are below).\n2. \"set a separate cross-layer penalty of 0.2 between the RNA and protein features\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set.\n3. \"set a separate cross-layer penalty of 0.2 between the RNA and protein features\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set.\n\nYou asked me to run DRAGON. It covers \"Please run DRAGON on our RNA and proteomics tables from the same 70 heart failure patients; both tables share the patient IDs.\", but \"set a separate cross-layer penalty of 0.2 between the RNA and protein features\" cannot be given as asked (above), so the run would do only part of what you asked. I have not planned it.\n\nTell me to run DRAGON for the part it gives, and I will then find your input files and show a preview; nothing runs until you approve it.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
